  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/infusedfoods/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"656\" height=\"84\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>浸染食物</strong>允許玩家將<strong>藥水效果</strong>注入食物物品中。</p>\n<p>要浸染食物，只需手持<strong>食物</strong>物品並與<strong>藥水鍋</strong>互動即可。<br><strong>藥水鍋</strong>的製作方法很簡單，只需將<strong>藥水</strong>容器物品倒入<strong>空鍋</strong>中即可。</p>\n<p>浸染的食物可以透過與<strong>淨化劑</strong>（<strong>牛奶桶</strong>）合成來進行淨化（移除浸染效果）。<br>浸染的食物也可以與<strong>蜘蛛眼</strong>合成，以在玩家的物品提示中隱藏其效果。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的<strong>Discord</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
